      "statement": "`scoped_boto_session` assumes `FionaaDataAccessRole` with STS session tags for `customer_id` and `application_id`, uses `TransitiveTagKeys=[\"customer_id\"]`, and relies on `DeferredRefreshableCredentials` so long-running graphs can re-assume the role when credentials expire.",
